      "seconds": 13,
      "scene": "initial",
      "url": "/",
      "zh": "批准是人的动作，不是模型的。四颗键：批准、暂缓、修改、拒绝；高风险的 T2 卡上没有一键批准，得先展开明细。批下去，卡就进入启动中。",
      "en": "Approval is a human action, not the model's. Four verbs — approve, defer, amend, reject — and a high-risk T2 card has no one-click approve until you have opened its details. Approve, and the card moves to starting up.",
